+## existing tests the lead must change (I did not touch them)
+- tests/test_flow.py::test_failed_retry and ::test_retry_twice_concurrent, and tests/test_mutants.py::test_mutant_no_claim (via retry_twice_body): they expect state `failed` right after one refused/unreachable send. Now it is `pending` (automatic retry) with last_error refused/unreachable. Fix: for a refused or unreachable first try expect ("pending", err); to reach `failed` advance the clock through 5 reaper passes with the sender still refusing.
